    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "sys",
     "author": {
      "role": "system"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       ""
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {
      "is_visually_hidden_from_conversation": true
     }
    }
   },
   "m1": {
    "id": "m1",
    "parent": "sys",
    "children": [
     "m2"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m1",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "幫我設計一個多租戶 SaaS 的事件表，Postgres 要怎麼規劃？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m2": {
    "id": "m2",
    "parent": "m1",
    "children": [
     "m3old",
     "m3"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m2",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "先決定隔離方式：共用表加 tenant_id，或每個租戶一個 schema。共用表比較好維護，備份也簡單。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m3": {
    "id": "m3",
    "parent": "m2",
    "children": [
     "m4"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m3",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "共用表。那 Postgres 的 MVCC 對寫入量大的表有什麼影響？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m4": {
    "id": "m4",
    "parent": "m3",
    "children": [
     "m5"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m4",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "每次 UPDATE 都會產生新版本的資料列，舊版本要等 VACUUM 清掉，所以寫入量大的表要注意膨脹。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m5": {
    "id": "m5",
    "parent": "m4",
    "children": [
     "m6"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m5",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "那索引要怎麼設計？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m6": {
    "id": "m6",
    "parent": "m5",
    "children": [
     "m7"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m6",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "索引先建在 (tenant_id, created_at)，大部分查詢都會用到這組。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m7": {
    "id": "m7",
    "parent": "m6",
    "children": [
     "m8"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m7",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "為什麼容器連不上宿主機的 Postgres？出現 connection refused 錯誤"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m8": {
    "id": "m8",
    "parent": "m7",
    "children": [
     "m9"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m8",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "容器裡的 localhost 指的是容器自己，不是你的電腦。改連 host.docker.internal 就能連到宿主機。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m9": {
    "id": "m9",
    "parent": "m8",
    "children": [
     "m10"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m9",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "pg_hba.conf 也得改嗎？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m10": {
    "id": "m10",
    "parent": "m9",
    "children": [
     "m11"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m10",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "改用 host.docker.internal 就能解決，另外放行 172.17.0.0/16 這個網段。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m11": {
    "id": "m11",
    "parent": "m10",
    "children": [
     "m12old",
     "m12"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m11",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "回到正題：MVCC 下長交易會讓表膨脹嗎？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m12": {
    "id": "m12",
    "parent": "m11",
    "children": [
     "m13"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m12",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "會。長交易讓 VACUUM 不能回收它之後產生的舊版本，表和索引都會膨脹。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m13": {
    "id": "m13",
    "parent": "m12",
    "children": [
     "m14"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m13",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "要怎麼監控膨脹？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m14": {
    "id": "m14",
    "parent": "m13",
    "children": [
     "m15"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m14",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "看 pg_stat_user_tables 的 n_dead_tup，或用 pgstattuple 估算膨脹比例。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m15": {
    "id": "m15",
    "parent": "m14",
    "children": [
     "m16"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m15",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "另外，即時通知要用 WebSocket 還是 SSE？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m16": {
    "id": "m16",
    "parent": "m15",
    "children": [
     "m17"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m16",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "單向推播用 SSE 就夠了，瀏覽器會自動重連；需要雙向才用 WebSocket。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m17": {
    "id": "m17",
    "parent": "m16",
    "children": [
     "m18"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "m17",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "SSE 斷線時怎麼補送？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m18": {
    "id": "m18",
    "parent": "m17",
    "children": [],
    "message": {
     "id": "m18",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "用 Last-Event-ID 記住最後一筆，伺服器從那之後補送。\n- 要不要用 Redis pub/sub 做多台廣播？\n- 事件保留多久，待確認\n你想看程式碼範例嗎？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "m3old": {
    "id": "m3old",
    "parent": "m2",
    "children": [
